      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A 60-ft-long, 10-ft-wide Line of miasma: each creature in it makes a CON save. On a failure it takes 4d10 Necrotic damage and is Poisoned for 1 minute, taking 2d10 Poison damage at the start of each of its turns and repeating the save at the end of each of its turns (ending it on a success). +1d10 initial damage per slot level above 4.</p>",
